{"id": "17-340-2-2", "zh": "中性", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-341-2-6", "zh": "下面讲中性词。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-342-2-7", "zh": "以 a 结尾的中性词 citta（心）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-343-2-14", "zh": "与前面一样，生起 si 等格尾；在“citta si”这里——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-344-2-13", "zh": "承接“napuṃsakehi”和“ato niccaṃ”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-345-2-6", "zh": "195. siṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-346-2-7", "zh": "si、aṃ，这是两个词。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-346-8-17", "zh": "在以 a 结尾的中性词之后，si 格尾一律变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-346-18-21", "zh": "经过省略元音、保持原形等步骤，得 cittaṃ。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-347-2-12", "zh": "在复数时，承接“yonaṃ ni napuṃsakehi”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-348-2-7", "zh": "196. ato niccaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-349-2-10", "zh": "在以 a 结尾的中性词之后，yo 一律变为 ni。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-349-11-22", "zh": "依“sabbayonīnamāe”，ni 可选地变为 ā。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-349-23-32", "zh": "其他情况下，依“yosu kata”等规则，元音变长。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-349-33-35", "zh": "得 cittā、cittāni。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-350-2-8", "zh": "yo 变为 ni，以及变为 ā、e，即使凭一般规则已经成立，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-351-2-13", "zh": "但由于另立了“ato niccaṃ”这条规则，可知这里变为 ā、e 只是偶尔才有。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-352-2-5", "zh": "在呼格中，省略 ga。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-352-6-17", "zh": "he citta，he cittā、cittāni；在第二格中，ni 可选地变为 e。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-352-18-22", "zh": "cittaṃ，citte、cittāni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-352-23-27", "zh": "其余变化与 purisa 一词相同。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-353-2-3", "zh": "其他的词也是这样——", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-354-2-7", "zh": "puñña（福德）、pāpa（恶）、phala（果）、rūpa（色）、sādhana（成就），", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-355-2-7", "zh": "sota（耳）、ghāna（鼻）、sukha（乐）、dukkha（苦）、kāraṇa（原因）；", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-356-2-7", "zh": "dāna（布施）、sīla（戒）、dhana（财富）、jhāna（禅那）、locana（眼睛），", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-357-2-6", "zh": "mūla（根）、kūla（岸）、bala（力）、jāla（网）、maṅgala（吉祥）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-358-2-11", "zh": "naḷina（莲花）、liṅga（性征）、mukha（口）、aṅga（肢体）、jala（水）、ambuja（莲花），", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-359-2-8", "zh": "pulina（沙洲）、dhañña（谷物）、hirañña（金子）、pada（足迹）、amata（甘露），", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-360-2-8", "zh": "paduma（红莲）、vaṇṇa（颜色）、susāna（坟场）、vana（森林）、āyudha（武器），", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-361-2-8", "zh": "hadaya（心脏）、cīvara（袈裟）、vattha（衣服）、kula（家族）、indriya（根）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-362-2-9", "zh": "nayana（眼睛）、vadana（脸）、yāna（车乘）、udāna（感兴语）、sopāna（阶梯）、pāna（饮料），", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-363-2-11", "zh": "bhavana（住处）、bhuvana（世界）、loha（金属）、alāta（火把）、tuṇḍa（鸟喙）、aṇḍa（卵）、pīṭha（座椅）；", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "17-364-2-10", "zh": "karaṇa（作为）、maraṇa（死亡）、ñāṇa（智）、ārammaṇa（所缘）、arañña（林野）、tāṇa（庇护），", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-365-2-8", "zh": "caraṇa（行）、nagara（城市）、tīra（岸）、chatta（伞）、chidda（孔洞）、udaka（水）——", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "17-366-2-3", "zh": "等等。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-367-2-6", "zh": "kamma 一词在第三格单数等处，词形有所不同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-368-2-18", "zh": "kammaṃ，kammā、kammāni，he kamma，he kammā、kammāni，kammaṃ，kamme、kammāni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-369-2-16", "zh": "承接“vā”“u”“nāmhi”“ca”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-370-2-8", "zh": "197. a kammantassa ca。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-371-2-13", "zh": "在 nā 格尾时，kamma 一词的词尾可选地替换为 u 音和 a 音。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-371-14-20", "zh": "由于用了“anta”一词，thāma、addha 等的词尾也变为 u。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-371-21-32", "zh": "由于用了“ca”一词，yuva、maghavā 等的词尾在 nā、su 等格尾时，有时变为 ā。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "17-371-33-40", "zh": "kammunā、kammanā 或 kammena，kammehi、kammebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-372-2-24", "zh": "在 sa、smā 格尾时：在“u nāmhi ca”这条规则里，已借“ca”一词说明，puma、kamma、thāma 的词尾在 sa、smā 格尾时也可选地变为 u。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "17-372-25-42", "zh": "kammuno、kammassa，kammānaṃ，kammunā、kammā、kammamhā、kammasmā，kammehi、kammebhi，kammuno、kammassa，kammānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-373-2-18", "zh": "在 smiṃ 格尾时，依“brahmato tu smiṃ nī”这条规则中的“tu”一词，有时变为 ni。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-373-19-25", "zh": "kammani、kamme、kammamhi、kammasmiṃ，kammesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-374-2-14", "zh": "同样，thāmunā、thāmena 或 thāmasā，thāmuno、thāmassa，thāmunā、thāmā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-374-15-20", "zh": "addhunā，addhuno 等，与前面相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-375-2-17", "zh": "guṇavantu si；承接“savibhattissa”“ntussa”“simhi”。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-376-2-7", "zh": "198. aṃ napuṃsake。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-377-2-14", "zh": "在 si 格尾时，用于中性的词干所带的 ntu 词缀连同格尾一起变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-377-15-17", "zh": "guṇavaṃ cittaṃ（有德的心）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-378-2-18", "zh": "在 yo 格尾时，依“ntussanto yosu ca”，词尾变为 a，并且出现 i 音。", "confidence": 62}
{"id": "17-378-19-25", "zh": "guṇavanti、guṇavantāni，其余可以类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-379-2-15", "zh": "gacchanta si；依“simhi gacchantādīnaṃ ntasaddo aṃ”，变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-379-16-21", "zh": "gacchaṃ、gacchantaṃ，gacchantā、gacchantāni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-380-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 a 结尾的词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-381-2-7", "zh": "以 ā 结尾的中性词 assaddhā（无信）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-382-2-9", "zh": "当成为“assaddhā”时——", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-383-2-25", "zh": "以“samāsassa”为总则，依“saro rasso napuṃsake”，复合词的词尾元音变短；因为是复合词，所以得名词之称，生起 si 等格尾。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-383-26-29", "zh": "其余变化与 citta 相同。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-384-2-9", "zh": "assaddhaṃ kulaṃ（无信的家族），assaddhā、assaddhāni kulāni，等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-385-2-5", "zh": "mukhanāsikā（口鼻）一词也是这样。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-385-6-9", "zh": "由于它是取单数形式的相违复合词，所以在各格中都只用单数。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-385-10-19", "zh": "mukhanāsikaṃ，he mukhanāsika，mukhanāsikaṃ，mukhanāsikena，等等。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-386-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 ā 结尾的词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-387-2-8", "zh": "以 i 结尾的中性词 aṭṭhi（骨）。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-388-2-9", "zh": "生起 si 等格尾，省略 si，得 aṭṭhi。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-389-2-9", "zh": "承接“vā”。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-390-2-8", "zh": "199. yonaṃ ni napuṃsakehi。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-391-2-9", "zh": "在中性词之后，所有的 yo 都可选地变为 ni。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-392-2-31", "zh": "得 aṭṭhīni；其他情况下 yo 一律省略，并且元音变长，得 aṭṭhī；同样有 he aṭṭhi，he aṭṭhī、aṭṭhīni，aṭṭhiṃ，aṭṭhī、aṭṭhīni，aṭṭhinā 等，与 aggi 一词相同。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-393-2-10", "zh": "同样还有 satthi（大腿）、dadhi（酪）、vāri（水）、akkhi（眼睛）、acchi（眼睛）、acci（火焰）等。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-394-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 i 结尾的词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-395-2-7", "zh": "以 ī 结尾的中性词 sukhakārī（带来安乐的）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-396-2-23", "zh": "在“sukhabhārī si”这里，由于是中性，在 si 格尾时也依“agho rassa”等规则元音变短，并省略 si。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "17-396-24-43", "zh": "sukhakāri dānaṃ（带来安乐的布施），sukhakārī、sukhakārīni，he sukhakāri，he sukhakārī、he sukhakārīni，sukhakārinaṃ、sukhakāriṃ，sukhakārī、sukhakārīni。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-397-2-5", "zh": "其余变化与 daṇḍī 一词相同。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "17-397-6-9", "zh": "sīghayāyī 等词也是这样。", "confidence": 85}
